		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld home folder</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld home folders</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Finder 기본 보기는 바꾸지 못했습니다: %@

홈 폴더 %lld개는 이미 변경됐습니다. 되돌리려면 툴바의 "기록"에서 이 작업을 고르세요.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>Finder's default view could not be changed: %@

%#@folders@ already changed. To undo, choose this operation in "History" in the toolbar.</string>
		<key>folders</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
